    {
     "amount_html": "<span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"ml\" data-a=\"200\">200 ml</span>",
     "name_html": "Water (rice)"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Line a small bowl with plastic wrap, leaving enough overhang to gather it closed. Sprinkle a little salt inside.</li><li>Add about <span class=\"q\" data-k=\"mass\" data-u=\"g\" data-a=\"50\" data-s=\"0\">50 g</span> warm rice, make a well, and put <span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tsp\" data-a=\"1\" data-b=\"2\" data-s=\"0\">1–2 tsp</span> prepared filling in the center.</li><li>Cover with another <span class=\"q\" data-k=\"mass\" data-u=\"g\" data-a=\"50\" data-s=\"0\">50 g</span> rice, seal it around the filling, and add a little salt on top.</li></ul>",
   "heat": null,
   "id": "step-2",
   "images": {
    "alt": "Fill the wrap",
    "diagram": null,
    "diagram_title": "Diagram",
    "how": [],
    "illustration": null,
    "photo": null,
    "result": null,
    "svg_fallback": null
   },
   "n": 2,
   "part": "Shape through wrap",
   "part_id": "part-shape-through-wrap",
   "time": null,
   "time_html": null,
   "title": "Fill the wrap",
   "uses_rows": []
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Gather the wrap above the rice and twist it closed. Shape gently through the wrap; do not squeeze the rice hard.</li><li>Cup the rice from underneath with your left hand. Bend your right hand into a roof to make one corner, turn the rice a third of a turn, and repeat for three corners.</li><li>Flatten each face lightly. Unwrap for serving; remove all plastic before eating.</li></ul>",
   "heat": null,
   "id": "step-3",
   "images": {
    "alt": "Gather and shape",
    "diagram": null,
